  (text "Confirm, Cancel and Recovery buttons support physical release and provisioning workflows.\\nStatus LEDs expose power, secure, isolated, armed, released and fault states.\\nTest points cover rails, SPI/I2C, reset/watchdog and all link-detect signals." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
